     [38;5;246mEnvironment map, active env resolved from location.hostname, with an explicit constant to override and force one.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Map + manual constant
     [38;5;246mEnvironment map with one ACTIVE_ENV line you edit by hand. Fully explicit, no implicit behavior.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Single flat config
     [38;5;246mOne config object with one endpoint. Simplest possible; switching environments is still a hand edit of the value.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m Hostname detect only
     [38;5;246mResolve purely from hostname with no override constant. Least code, but you cannot force an environment locally.[39m
